<title>SWEDEN: Saab Auto posts 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Saab Auto posts 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saab Auto on Friday released its results for calendar 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Result after tax, before extras   LOSS 1,240  vs	0</p>
<p> Operating result			  LOSS 658  vs    737 PROFIT</p>
<p> Sales					   19,681  vs 19,965</p>
<p>NOTE - Saab Automobile AB is jointly owned by U.S. auto group General Motors and Swedish investment group Investor AB.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
